  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Description: Make your charger as stylish as your phone with our Heart iPhone Charger Case Set. Each set includes a protective charger case and a matching braided cable, both designed with a cute 3D heart accent. Made from durable materials, these cases keep your adapter safe from scratches and wear while giving it a trendy, aesthetic look. The tangle-free braided cable ensures long-lasting use and completes the coordinated design.",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:<br>Make your charger as stylish as your phone with our Heart iPhone Charger Case Set. Each set includes a protective charger case and a matching braided cable, both designed with a cute 3D heart accent. Made from durable materials, these cases keep your adapter safe from scratches and wear while giving it a trendy, aesthetic look. The tangle-free braided cable ensures long-lasting use and completes the coordinated design.</p>"
